# Temporal Platform Overview

## What is Temporal?

Temporal is a durable execution platform that guarantees your application code runs to completion, even in the face of failures. It provides a programming model for building reliable, scalable distributed systems.

Platform Version: Temporal Server 1.23+, SDKs as specified per language

