## Resource Requirements

### Local Development
- CPU: 2+ cores
- RAM: 4GB+
- Disk: 10GB+

### Production (Self-Hosted)
- Frontend: 2+ instances (2 CPU, 4GB RAM each)
- History: 4+ instances (4 CPU, 8GB RAM each)
- Matching: 2+ instances (2 CPU, 4GB RAM each)
- Worker: Based on workload (scale horizontally)
- Database: Highly available PostgreSQL/Cassandra

### Temporal Cloud
- No infrastructure needed
- Pay per action executed
- Automatic scaling

## Security Model

### Authentication
- mTLS for service-to-service
- API keys for Temporal Cloud
- OAuth integration support

### Authorization
- Namespace isolation
- Task queue permissions
- Role-based access control

### Encryption
- TLS in transit
- Data encryption at rest
- Payload encryption (custom codecs)

